{
 "title": "All the Deform modifiers",
 "summary": "A gallery of the Deform modifiers as the tutor shows them: Cast (a subdivided cube into a sphere; on Suzanne the factor keyed 0 -> 1 over 100 frames), Curve (a subdivided bar along a Bezier arch), Displace (a vertex group with a noise texture), Hook (a corner dragged by an empty), Laplacian Deform (three hooked corners as anchors, bound, one moved: the cube bends smoothly), Lattice (a sphere shaped by a 3x3x3 lattice), Mesh Deform (Suzanne in a bound cage, the cage edited), Shrinkwrap (a plane wrapped over a sphere), Simple Deform twist / bend / taper on tall bars, Smooth, Laplacian Smooth (spikes relaxed), Surface Deform (a bar bound to a plane that is then bent), Warp (a plane pulled between two empties) and Wave (animated ripples).",
